{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"1e794cc1-1e19-4fac-86f0-2a8e936c6a14":{"type":"hero-video","settings":{"title":"DELIVERED FAST","title_size":70,"subheading":"High quality Cheerleading, Gymnastics, Martial Arts, and other Sports mats from Canada Mats.","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-left","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/19395f4a3c274aafa82423f661733009.mp4","overlay_opacity":30,"section_height":"450px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"5233ba91-5d77-4a78-b50d-aac632f08458":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cheer_l2_1_53d451ba-b4f4-4118-beb0-54226f28271b.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Competition Grade","title":"Cheerleading Mats","text":"<p>Our cheerleading mats are made from a shock-absorbent foam and carpet surface. Cheerleading Mats can be easily rolled up and set up so they are very convenient to be used for various sporting events or competitions.<\/p><p>They feature a carpet top for added comfort and traction.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$7.75\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy Cheerleading Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cheerleading-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"127605e9-326d-460a-b7bc-7f3681c90dd3":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"a1797236-2d08-4d3c-b0ce-fc525efd380b":{"type":"banner","settings":{"heading":"Many colors and sizes are available to ship today!","text":"Click on the product to see availability.","link":"","label":"","color_tint":"#33ff3f","color_tint_opacity":6,"framed":true}}},"block_order":["a1797236-2d08-4d3c-b0ce-fc525efd380b"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"gutter_size":5,"space_above":false,"space_below":false}},"7b9250b4-4209-434d-90b9-5e92f71aed9a":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_76_cdd31b56-7f65-4915-8e03-077d0d93dad4.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"2\" Cross Link Foam Mats","text":"<p>Engineered to <strong>minimize injuries<\/strong>, cross link foam mats provide a firm surface that <strong>creates sure footing <\/strong>while providing<strong> <\/strong>enough<strong> shock absorption<\/strong> for smooth landings.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.58\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy 2\" Cross link foam mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/karate-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"KNOW THE DIFFERENCE, GET THE RIGHT FOAM FOR YOUR NEEDS"}},"template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Whether you need firmer footing, extra padding, or a softer landing, we've got the right product for your sport.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-0","template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cross-Linked_PE_Foam_2_1.gif","image_width":300,"title":"1 3\/8\" Cross Link Foam Mats","text":"<p>Engineered to <strong>enhance stability <\/strong>and<strong> <\/strong>prevent your feet from digging in, this premium foam provides <strong>unparalleled firmness<\/strong> that <strong>minimizes the risk of injuries<\/strong> during gymnastics activities.<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$8.33\/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY CROSS LINK FOAM MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/tumbling-super-mats"}},"c281d67f-eb7b-4e8f-9dc1-aa71b43ec344":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dual_Foam_Cora.gif","image_width":300,"title":"DUAL FOAM CORE SYSTEM","text":"<p>A combination of Cross link and Rebond foams creates the perfect folding gym mat. <strong>Firm on the top to provide support <\/strong>and prevent your feet digging in while <strong>absorbent at bottom for added shock absorption.<\/strong><br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$9.58 \/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY COMBO GYMNASTIC MATS","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/combo-gymnastic-mats"}},"template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/03b.gif","image_width":300,"title":"POLYURETHANE FOAM","text":"<p>PU foam is a <strong>dense and durable<\/strong> foam that provides <strong>excellent shock absorption and cushioning<\/strong>, making it suitable for general workouts as well as some falling and tumbling.<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$8.12 \/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY VARSITY EXERCISE MAT","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/varsity-folding-mats"}},"template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Rebond_Foam_1.gif","image_width":300,"title":"Rebond foam","text":"<p>Rebond foam is made from recycled foam pieces bonded together. It offers <strong>superior shock absorption and durability<\/strong>, making it a popular choice for activities that require heavy tumbling and falls.<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$8.12 \/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY ALL-PURPOSE TUMBLING MATS","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/all-purpose-tumbling-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-0","c281d67f-eb7b-4e8f-9dc1-aa71b43ec344","template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-1","template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54":{"type":"logo-list","blocks":{"template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-0":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/puncture_resistant1.png","link":""}},"template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-1":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/spacesaving.png","link":""}},"template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-2":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/easymaintenance.png","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-0","template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-1","template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-2"],"settings":{"title":"","logo_opacity":100,"divider":false}},"d09f51a6-512c-47b6-a298-48ea3cce95c3":{"type":"background-video-text","settings":{"subtitle":"Roll Out","title":"WRESTLING & Martial Arts MATS","text":"<p>Designed for competitions and events, these mats are quick to set up, light-weight, easy to move, and pack up. Made from shock-absorbent EVA foam and a carpet surface, these mats provide excellent protection against impact injuries and are ideal for experienced athletes.<\/p>","button_label":"BUY ROLL OUT COMBAT SPORTS MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/roll-out-combat-sports-mats","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopif