strong><\/em><\/p><p><strong>Designed for easy installation <\/strong>in Home Gyms<\/p>","button_label":"BUY TITAN GYM TILES","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/throw-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-0","template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-1"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"GENERAL PURPOSE FOLDING MATS FOR ALL SPORTS"}},"template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>For beginners or general use, these mats provides a safe learning and practice surface.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-0","template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_12_27f6f1a3-323f-4977-98e6-827ab2b2bacd.png","image_width":500,"title":"All-purpose tumbling mats","text":"<p>These all purpose mats are perfect for beginners that are learning to fall and tumble. Constructed out of rebonded foam and designed to provide the most amount of cushioning and impact absorption. These are ideal for general physical activities.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Beginner Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$8.90\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy all-purpose tumbling mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/all-purpose-tumbling-mats"}},"template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_5_b18b799d-52e5-4e21-94e1-9bd61cf7300c.png","image_width":500,"title":"varsity exercise mat","text":"<p>Made out of 2” 100 ILD polyurethane Foam, these mats provide a very firm and stable surface. They are great for general exercises such as aerobics, but are not ideal ideal for impact absorption sports involving falls and throws.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Beginner to Amateur Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.88\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy varsity exercise mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/varsity-folding-mats"}},"template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}},"ae2fa1ba-757c-47df-87d8-2d6d0cbcd2e8":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-0","template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-1","template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-2","ae2fa1ba-757c-47df-87d8-2d6d0cbcd2e8"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"","align